abstract: >-
  Verification-first research program testing whether machine-native artifacts can
  certify mathematical and representation-geometry structure before compact human
  projection exists — Protocol v2 gates, certificate.json witnesses, Sci Flow
  domain routing, AMAT pilots 037–041, compression asymmetry (K_A/K_H), and
  open-problem shadows. Negative and null results are first-class (rejections.jsonl).
